{"v":1,"id":"9483bf7d102d","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"Blessed are all those","s":14.12,"e":16.52},{"t":"With their heads raised toward Heaven,","s":16.6,"e":20.09},{"t":"Who do continually look up","s":20.15,"e":23.14},{"t":"In anticipation of My coming…","s":23.26,"e":28.35},{"t":"They shall surely be gone from this place!","s":28.4,"e":34.24},{"t":"†","s":32.25,"e":34.24},{"t":"Blessed are the wise who wait and watch,","s":34.27,"e":36.64},{"t":"And see these things come to pass","s":36.74,"e":40.93},{"t":"During their generation…","s":41.04,"e":47.71},{"t":"Blessed are the faithful,","s":47.79,"e":50.01},{"t":"For they shall be lifted up.","s":50.07,"e":54.34},{"t":"†","s":51.66,"e":54.34},{"t":"Blessed is the one who finds","s":54.38,"e":56.33},{"t":"His way to Me,","s":56.44,"e":60.51},{"t":"Without the hindrances of men.","s":60.54,"e":63.6},{"t":"†","s":62.42,"e":63.6},{"t":"Blessed are those who diligently","s":63.63,"e":66.38},{"t":"Seek after God,","s":66.46,"e":68.36},{"t":"For they will surely find Me…","s":68.42,"e":75.13},{"t":"But know this:","s":75.19,"e":77.03},{"t":"I am also He who corrects","s":77.15,"e":79.71},{"t":"And disciplines those He loves.","s":79.79,"e":84.53},{"t":"†","s":81.24,"e":84.53},{"t":"Blessed is the man who comes to Me","s":84.57,"e":87.53},{"t":"Ashamed of his trespasses,","s":87.61,"e":90.7},{"t":"Whose heart is full of grief","s":90.77,"e":93.67},{"t":"On account of his sins…","s":93.79,"e":97.76},{"t":"For I am faithful to forgive his sins.","s":97.8,"e":104.39},{"t":"Indeed, I shall lift him up","s":104.4,"e":107.55},{"t":"And set his feet","s":107.66,"e":112.42},{"t":"Upon hallowed ground.","s":112.52,"e":115.69}],"match":null}
